ind":"announcement","title":"Beyond the demo: what's waiting for you in the full game","summary":"Thank you to everyone playing the You're Nuts! demo during Steam Next Fest! 🔩The demo covers the first days of your escape, across Sectors D and C. But there's a lot more waiting for you in the full game, so here's a sneak peek:A factory that talks back: the factory has a voice, the system that has kept the facility running since the humans left. It comments on everything your crew does, sets up the story and helps you understand what you're really trying to achieve.An opening cinematic: your es","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:38:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696181","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854950-1846651706691459","game_id":"steam-3854950","kind":"announcement","title":"We're at Steam Next Fest! Play the free demo now","summary":"Steam Next Fest is here, and You're Nuts! is part of it! 🔩 Wake up, little robot: it's time to plan your escape. Our free demo takes you through the first days of the adventure, across Sectors D and C, solo or with up to 3 friends. The key is waiting in Sector A.Set it up your way From super cozy to nearly impossible: every challenge can be adjusted to how you like to play. Tell us how it went Share your thoughts in our demo feedback thread, or with the feedback form in the main menu. We read ev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854950-1845383656396845","game_id":"steam-3854950","kind":"announcement","title":"The You're Nuts! demo is out now, plus a Friend's Pass reveal","summary":"Our tiny robots have woken up, and they want out. The free demo of You're Nuts! is out now on Steam, so grab some friends (or go solo) and start your escape! What is You're Nuts!?Think Maze Runner, but you puzzle your way out. You're self-aware robots locked in an abandoned factory, and the only way to escape is to solve your way through a maze full of puzzles.Every day you head out, crack puzzles that open the way forward and grab loot, always with one eye on your battery. Then it's back to bas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T15:33:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396845","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854950-1843481262692740","game_id":"steam-3854950","kind":"announcement","title":"Last days of the You're Nuts! Playtest 🤖🔩","summary":"The playtest has been open for a couple of weeks now, and we've decided to keep it running through the weekend, but this Sunday, September 13, we're closing it for good.If you've been meaning to jump in, this is your window. And if you've already played: thank you, genuinely. There's one thing we'd ask before we wrap up.We need your feedback 🙏The playtest itself is only half the point: the other half is hearing what you thought. So far we've had fewer responses than we hoped, and every single on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T16:19:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692740","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854950-1842212951296850","game_id":"steam-3854950","kind":"announcement","title":"The You're Nuts! Playtest is now OPEN! 🤖🔩","summary":"Hey everyone!The first public playtest for You're Nuts! is now OPEN! 👀Our team has been working passionately on this new game, and we're so eager to open a public playtest for the first players to enjoy what we've been creating.It's not a finished product, and it's not complete — we really need you to know this 🙏 — but the idea is to give you the opportunity to try the game, try the experience, and give us feedback so we can polish it into something you'll all enjoy a lot.A feedback form is avai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T13:09:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854950-1827626365768057","game_id":"steam-3854950","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Sign-Ups Are Open","summary":"Hey everyone!We’re thrilled to announce that the You’re Nuts! Steam Playtest sign-ups are now live!What is You’re Nuts!?A cozy 1–4 player co-op puzzle escape adventure. You play as sentient robots who’ve awakened inside a silent, decaying factory. Your mission: solve puzzles, scavenge parts, craft upgrades, and find the exit — all before the day ends and you’re forced back to your hub.What does signing up mean?By clicking \"Request Access\" on the store page, you’re joining the playtest list. When","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T12:52:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365768057","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3854950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3854950":"2026-10-26T11:01:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_so